  "title": "Gingerbread S'mores Muffins",
  "description": "Spiced gingerbread muffins filled with melty marshmallows and chocolate chips will remind you of the classic summer dessert--s'mores!",
  "authors": [
    "gerry"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:41:17-04:00",
